# Static table lookup for hostnames.
# See hosts(5) for details.
127.0.0.1	localhost
::1		localhost
127.0.1.1	whisker.localdomain	whisker

# FBK wired subnet (10.40.40.0/23). FBK publishes no DNS for these names and no
# PTR records, so /etc/hosts is the only way to resolve them on campus.
#
# NOTE: these are DHCP leases, not reservations -- whisker itself drew .217 and
# .222 from the same pool on consecutive attempts. If a name starts reaching the
# wrong machine, re-check with `ip -4 -br addr` on the host itself.
#
# Only add a 127.0.1.1 alias for THIS machine. Pointing a remote host's name at
# loopback makes `ssh <host>` silently connect back to whisker.
10.40.40.223	aai
10.40.41.89	sterzing
10.40.40.221	vigolana
